resolution: "Reverified main eebda9277e52 (unchanged since audit): [PR #148](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/148) (dc86e83) preserves authoritative legacy GitHub ownership across copied provider examples. Retained evidence: closeout.ts, import-fidelity.ts, test/closeout.test.ts."
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T04:05:33.037Z",codex-agent,"Round 1: issue read in full; searched existing tracker and no issue-specific import exists. Implement in fix/import-and-release-issues from origin/main; add behavioral revert proof and run unchanged npm and Bun release gates with isolated CI identity."
  "2026-10-18T04:09:03.582Z",codex-agent,"Legacy gh provenance now excludes copied body/label provider hints while explicit provider identities, descriptors and exporter description provenance stay authoritative. Baseline with new tests: 4/4 plain/atomic copied-body/label migrations fail. Each fixture checks native title/status/lifetime and GitHub ownership on retry; six external-owner controls preserve their owner."
  "2026-10-18T04:09:51.096Z",codex-agent,"Isolated revert proof: restore only import-fidelity.ts to origin/main with new tests unchanged; all 4/4 copied-body/label migration tests fail on stale native title. Restore the fix: combined real-tracker acceptance passes 23/23 (10 legacy ownership/control cases plus 13 closeout cases), zero skips."
  "2026-10-18T04:57:07.381Z",codex-agent,"Issue #143: 10/10 real-SDK legacy/control fixtures pass; reverting only import-fidelity.ts fails all 4/4 migration cases. Both full CI release commands PASS at 956ae58201a9058f19fab2ca6e265b7426374639: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 824/824, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules. Isolated HOME and global/system Git identity were enforced. Receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542763 and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542909 . Remove the temporary validation workflow; implementation/tests remain unchanged. Regenerate the changelog after ALL final tracker writes. Item remains in progress and unclaimed for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-18T06:53:56.244Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 follow-up after merging current main: no unresolved review threads or substantive CodeRabbit review are present. Existing implementation and behavioral revert proofs are unchanged. Re-run this item's linked real regression command and collect both exact isolated npm/Bun release receipts; retain Fixes links and leave closure to the orchestrator."
  "2026-10-18T06:58:59.229Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 integration validation: the linked legacy GitHub ownership command passes 10/10. Both exact isolated-identity npm/Bun release gates pass 836/836 at 762285d94e90e645927b90e8032292c191772b49, with complete 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 modules. Existing behavioral revert proof and implementation remain unchanged. Fresh-clone strict health passes. Full gate receipts: actions/runs/39105101037. No CodeRabbit review is available yet; final CI will be recorded in the PR body."
  "2026-10-18T09:36:33.654Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 review round: merged origin/main including #146 and #147 before implementation. Read the one unresolved CodeRabbit thread and latest complete review; all open issues inspected, with #141/#143/#145 retaining body closing links. Confirmed provider-only descriptor is omitted from ownership text. Add plain/atomic real-tracker retry regressions without external_url, prove failure with only the fix reverted, then run isolated npm and Bun release gates."
  "2026-10-18T09:39:34.311Z",codex-agent,"CodeRabbit thread PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM6to9nE: include declared provider in providerProvenance ownership text. New plain/atomic real-SDK cases omit external_url and github_link_only, preserve native title/status/lifecycle/release/body/tags and one owner over two retries. Behavioral revert proof: restored only the changed providerProvenance predicate with tests retained; 2/2 cases failed on overwritten native title (exit 1). Restoring the fix passes both; combined legacy/provider matrix passes 12/12. Command: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"provider-only descriptor\" test/import-fidelity.test.ts. No history rewrite or receipt reconciliation was needed; this merge generated no receipts."
  "2026-10-18T10:21:24.132Z",codex-agent,"Validation moved to isolated GitHub-hosted runners after shared-host contention made workflow acceptance cases take minutes each. Temporary validation branch commit 4790a23983261583055791ad951ed47211d69770 differs from PR source commit 0b6d7cb3eef2d056adecd4c44fa47817b177e6c3 only by its validation workflow; implementation/tests/tracker/dependency pins are identical. Exact isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check are running at actions/runs/39118834540; strict tracker health passed in both jobs. Duplicate local full runs were stopped as incomplete, without observed failures; they are not passing gate evidence."
  "2026-10-18T10:29:47.237Z",codex-agent,"First hosted validation attempt exposed an error in the temporary validation workflow: the attestation auditor correctly rejects a matrix expression in command position. npm completed 893 tests with 892 passes and only the own-workflows attestation test failing; source coverage remained exactly 100/100/100/100. Replaced the temporary workflow command with literal npm and bun invocations and verified it with the canonical auditor locally. Validation head is now 059e4f0ed9308c9970ee4af6df941fcda8afe804; only the temporary workflow differs from source commit 0b6d7cb3eef2d056adecd4c44fa47817b177e6c3. No PR production code or tests changed. Superseded validation is not approval or passing gate evidence."
  "2026-10-18T10:42:32.509Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 final review receipt: CodeRabbit provider-only descriptor finding fixed in 0b6d7cb3eef2d056adecd4c44fa47817b177e6c3. Linked legacy ownership cases PASS 10/10 and provider-only cases PASS 2/2, preserving native fields/tags and one owner on retry. Reverting only the changed providerProvenance predicate makes both new tests fail; restoring it passes. Thread will receive sha/test reply after pushing and remain unresolved as requested. Exact isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check both PASS: 893/893 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules, unchanged thresholds. Hosted receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39119457879 (npm job 117651896197; Bun job 117651896368). Validation commit 059e4f0ed9308c9970ee4af6df941fcda8afe804 differs from source commit 0b6d7cb3eef2d056adecd4c44fa47817b177e6c3 only by a temporary validation workflow. Final-head CI will be reported in the PR. Claims released without closing items; orchestrator owns closure."
  "2026-10-21T18:38:30.501Z",codex-agent,"Reverified main eebda9277e52 (unchanged since audit): [PR #148](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/148) (dc86e83) preserves authoritative legacy GitHub ownership across copied provider examples. Retained evidence: closeout.ts, import-fidelity.ts, test/closeout.test.ts."
